s=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment red\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Red Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Phiarlan_Spy_Dagger.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Phiarlan_Spy_Dagger.png/420px-Epic_Phiarlan_Spy_Dagger.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"694\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Phiarlan_Spy_Dagger.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Phiarlan_Spy_Dagger\" title=\"Item:Legendary Phiarlan Spy Dagger\">Legendary Phiarlan Spy Dagger</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>House Phiarlan assassins and spies carry daggers like this when they need to carry out a mission efficiently and from the shadows. This particular blade drips acid when drawn and can lure foes into letting down their guard.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-c